+# V11 entry/prelude diagnostic
+
+Existing --routine-cost additionally offers a separate first-observed-entry button. It waits for the original accepted Actor false→true at outer prepareFrame and captures8 original prepare→stable→Scene chains under one30s deadline. First/cold is a fresh-session claim, never inferred from this observer alone. Original eight-routine button/modules are unchanged. New vehicle-entry-cost receipt records per-frame wall timestamps, engine and scene IDs, vehicle flags, three outer scopes, overlapping nested work and explicit failure/restoration evidence. glTF direct refresh inside Scene is included in Scene only. Engine ID stays unchanged inside render; Scene progresses1. No product/GPU/readiness/input/network calls are added. Exact snapshot singleton classes/methods, lifecycle and foreign-descriptor guards; defaultoff no hooks or Game reads. Only one installed attempt per Game.
+
+Use a fresh immutable helper build. Root alone runs actual first-entry capture. CPU fixtures are not GPU image, submission, performance or cold-entry acceptance. Public entry-render-helper evidence records research/variants, all source/protected hashes and exact verification.
+
 Native Promise observation is restricted to the original vanilla native-prototype/constructor/species shape; exotic constructor/species accessors are not invoked and produce truthful unsupported-promise evidence. Original return is still untouched. Missing own renderer/generation identity refuses observation. CPU fixtures use deliberately synthetic scalar timing values; they are not recovered source10 timings.
 
